# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to Cloud Build: the code the image needs,
# and nothing else. Without this file it would upload the whole folder, data
# and model outputs included. The dictionary does not come from here either:
# Cloud Build copies it from the EU bucket (deploy/cloudbuild.yaml).
/*
!/pyproject.toml
!/karimi/
!/karimi_normalise/
!/deploy/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
